WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.129
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright is Not Allowed

00:00:06.129 --> 00:00:10.120
to Kick SCP-2558-J!

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:14.120
SCP-2558-J refers to a group of seemingly
ordinary kittens, who display friendly and

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:17.150
affectionate behavior toward humans and each
other.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:21.730
When startled or made to feel afraid, the
kittens inflate into a fluffy spherical shape

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:25.420
about the size of a soccer ball, able to move
around by rolling.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.532
Dr. Bright is not permitted to kick any of
the kittens, whether they are in their ball

00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:30.970
form or not.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:35.450
He is also strictly prohibited from playing
dodgeball, volleyball, or any other ball-based

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:38.620
game with SCP-2558-J.

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:43.230
The only way anyone is permitted to play with
the kittens is using the Foundation-sanctioned

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.940
cat toys provided upon request.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.079
For crying out loud, man, they're kittens!

